# Non-goals (v1)

Do not implement unless the user explicitly reopens the decision:

- Zepp OS or Garmin as the first platform; watch-only app with no phone match
- Flutter as a watch client
- Custom score/timer UI on Xiaomi Band, Huawei Band, or CMF (notification + vibration only)
- Automatic pause from motion; second yellow auto-red; combined Goal+Card flow
- Extra Pre-Match / Ready / Review **screens** as gates (READY and FULL TIME are states, not extra routes)
- React Native for the MVP phone app; Hive/JSON files as primary match DB; Auth/network gating Kick-off
- CRDT / live crew merge; Anonymous Auth as the offline architecture
- IAP/paywalls inside `match_core`; `review` match status; activating `pens` in MVP
- Pricing by referee income, GPS, or `referee_level`; mixing geography / level / plan — `docs/pricing.md`
- Live watch-to-watch Bluetooth sync
- On-watch speech-to-text during the match
- Treating informal ChatGPT/Gemini notes as source of truth (canonical: `AGENTS.md` and `docs/`)

Full lists: `docs/mvp-scope.md`, `docs/platforms.md`.
